{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1194707-npc-the-superhero-spirit","id":1194707,"title":"[NPC] The Superhero Spirit","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-12T19:52:32-07:00","id":1194707,"title":"[NPC] The Superhero Spirit","content":"<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://cdnb.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/000/057/571/large/_Steelwill_24_WEB.jpg?1399442796\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Aegis, Unconquered And Incorruptible</b><br /> <b>Rank:</b> 5 (Spirit)<br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Power 15, Finesse 13, Resistance 15<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 10<br /> <b>Essence: </b>50<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> 15<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 13<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 178 (Species Factor 150)<br /> <b>Size: </b>6<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> 21<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Courage 3, Justice 3<br /> <b>Manifestation:</b> Twilight Form, Claim, Fetter, Materialize, Possess, Unfetter<br /> <b>Numina:</b> Aggressive Meme, Armored*, Awe, Blast (Solar Vision), Fist Of The Hero*, Heal*, Host Jump, Mortal Mask, Occult Sight*, Omen Trance, Regenerate, Seek, Teleportation*, Unyielding Steps Of Conviction*, Price Of Power* x 2<br /> <b>Ban 1:</b> Cannot refuse to save an innocent life in danger within his presence<br /> <b>Ban 2:</b> Must keep the true identities of those it Claims a secret from those who wish them harm<br /> <b>Bane 1:</b> A weapon used to murder a great hero in cold blood in front of their friends while their back was turned<br /> <b>Bane 2:</b> The badge of an important authority figure who turned to a life of crime due to a horrible tragedy and never looked back<br /> <br /> <b>*Armored:</b> A spirit with this Numen is difficult to injure, and are often manifest impressively armored forms. The Spirit spends 1 Essence point to gain Armor equal to its Rank until the end of scene. This armor does not apply against the Spirit's Bane.<br /> <br /> <b>*Fist Of The Hero:</b> Aegis' melee attacks deal supernatural damage, ignore all mundane Durability/Armor and have a Lethal Damage Bonus equal to his Rank, which can become Bashing at will. Whenever he fills someone's health with bashing or lethal damage, he may prevent them from falling unconscious or bleeding out, respectively. Whenever he attacks, he may spend 1 Essence and roll Power + Finesse vs Resolve + Composure + Supernatural Tolerance. If he wins, the target immediately suffers the Beaten Down Tilt, even if they would normally be immune to it.<br /> <br /> <b>*Heal: </b>The entity can heal others\u2019 wounds, typically for a hefty price. This Numen costs 1 Essence and a Power+ Finesse roll to activate. Each success heals 2 bashing damage or 1 lethal damage. Two Successes can be used to mend aggravated damage, but each point of aggravated damage cured costs 2 additional points of Essence. This power may also be used to fight off disease or the effects of poison \u2014 each Success adding to the subjects\u2019 resistance rolls on a one-to-one basis.\u200b<br /> <br /> <b>*Occult Sight:</b> Aegis is sensitive to supernatural phenomena. He notices the active use of supernatural abilities within the range of his senses and may make Perception rolls to approximate their distance and direction. In addition, by spending a point of Essence, he can see through powers of concealment, illusion and deceit with a Clash Of Wills using his Power + Finesse as his dice pool. Lastly, he always knows when he is being targeted by a supernatural power and may mimic the Aura Reading Supernatural Merit, but without drawback.<br /> <br /> <b>*Teleportation:</b> When the entity moves, it may reflexively spend 1 Essence to vanish and reappear at another location within its line of sight up to its (Rank x Speed) in yards away. Doing so adds +2 to its Defense for the turn. If the entity has the Seek Numen, it may teleport to the nearest location with a suitable Condition by spending 3 Essence. The entity can spend an additional 2 points of Essence to take a passenger with them (an unwilling passage may resist with a roll of Resolve + Composure + Supernatural Tolerance).<br /> <br /> <b>*Unyielding Steps Of Conviction:</b> Should the target have any supernatural means of protection, escape or mind control, Aegis triggers a Clash of Wills using his Power + Finesse. On a Success, the opposing power is canceled for the scene.<br /> <br /> <b>*Price Of Power:</b> By taking on an additional Ban or Bane, an entity can increase its repertoire of abilities. Each additional Ban or Bane can give it one of the following.<br /> <br /> * Two Numina, Influence dots, or Manifestations.<br /> * An increase of its maximum Essence pool by 5.<br /> * A Dread Power.<br /> <br /> An entity may take this Numen a number of times equal to its Rank.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i><b>NEW MYSTERY CULT: The Fan Club Of Aegis</b></i></span><br /> <br /> <b>1st Dot:</b> Allies 1 (Vigilantes).<br /> <br /> <b>2nd Dot:</b> Investigative Aide for Investigation, Empathy or Streetwise.<br /> <br /> <b>3rd Dot:</b> Iron Will. This disregards the prerequisites.<br /> <br /> <b>4th Dot:</b> Inspiring. This disregards the prerequisites.<br /> <br /> <b>5th Dot:</b> The <i><b><u>Transformation Bracelet of Aegis</u></b></i>, which gives one the Omen Sensitivity Supernatural Merit (using Resolve instead of Wits if higher) and allows one to summon and get Claimed by him with an extended Resolve + Composure roll requiring 1 minute per roll and 10 Successes. This Claiming happens instantly, is temporary and causes Breaking Points as normal. And so might the acts one performs in the name of heroism while Claimed by Aegis. He may use Seek and Host Jump Numina to instantly transfer the Claimed Condition to anyone who also possesses this Relic within the appropriate radius.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 03-16-2018, 12:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T20:26:04-07:00","id":1194714,"title":"","content":"Author's note: Aegis may be either a Spirit or a special Goetia.<br /> <br /> If he is the former, he is just as mono-maniacal and ultimately predatory as any other Spirit, and the relevant supernaturals such as Werewolves will react accordingly.<br /> <br /> If he is the latter, he is closer to a Superman-like psychic embodiment of mankind's hopes and ideals, and thus much closer to the symbol of the Superhero.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T20:28:06-07:00","id":1194715,"title":"","content":"I feel like Fist of the Hero could be at least two Numina; one for damage enhancement/suppression, and one for preventing escape/protection. And why does he have Heal?<br /> <br /> Otherwise, this is golden. Although the pack of <i>Iminir</i> chilling over there may disagree...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T20:32:49-07:00","id":1194717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1194707-npc-the-superhero-spirit?p=1194715#post1194715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like Fist of the Hero could be at least two Numina; one for damage enhancement/suppression, and one for preventing escape/protection. And why does he have Heal?<br /> <br /> Otherwise, this is golden. Although the pack of <i>Iminir</i> chilling over there may disagree...</div> </div> </div> </div>I am glad you liked him!<br /> <br /> That is a good point. I gave him the Heal Numen because it is useful for saving people. I can see Fist Of The Hero being a combat Numen, while a second Numen triggers a Clash of Wills against supernatural means of escaping from him or controlling his mind. What do you say?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T20:47:59-07:00","id":1194722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1194707-npc-the-superhero-spirit?p=1194717#post1194717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am glad you liked him!<br /> <br /> That is a good point. I gave him the Heal Numen because it is useful for saving people. I can see Fist Of The Hero being a combat Numen, while a second Numen triggers a Clash of Wills against supernatural means of escaping from him or controlling his mind. What do you say?</div> </div> </div> </div>Go right ahead, of course. <br /> <br /> And for the Friends of Aegis, what is their Relic as a Mystery Cult? Some sort of Bat-signal used to summon him?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Just adding another word, this spirit is a really good foil for the Storm Lords. On one hand, standing up for and rallying the weak to fight back is something Storm Lords can understand. On the other, Aegis is perpetuating that weakness by doing the heavy bulk of fighting for them, instead of helping them rise beyond themselves. Not to mention all the Claiming. (Or did I misunderstand how the cult works?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":12619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","user":"21C Hermit","date":". 03-12-2018, 11:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T20:52:41-07:00","id":1194725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1194707-npc-the-superhero-spirit?p=1194722#post1194722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Go right ahead, of course.<br /> <br /> And for the Friends of Aegis, what is their Relic as a Mystery Cult? Some sort of Bat-signal used to summon him?</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly, that is what I tried to imply with the 5th Dot Benefit (and also reference shows like Ultraman and Power Rangers).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T21:09:33-07:00","id":1194729,"title":"","content":"And now I\u2019m imagining a brood of magath formed of superhero spirits both fictional and existing, sustained only by their fans and cultists. (I mean, surely the concepts of things like Bat and Vigilantism aren\u2019t natural enough to avoid magath-hood?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T01:03:39-07:00","id":1194759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1194707-npc-the-superhero-spirit?p=1194714#post1194714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Author's note: Aegis may be either a Spirit or a special Goetia.<br /> <br /> If he is the former, he is just as mono-maniacal and ultimately predatory as any other Spirit, and the relevant supernaturals such as Werewolves will react accordingly.<br /> <br /> If he is the latter, he is closer to a Superman-like psychic embodiment of mankind's hopes and ideals, and thus much closer to the symbol of the Superhero.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or, with that appearance, an Angel.<br /> <br /> Or, for Booster Gold-like heroes, an Achronal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}